# Telemetry sync (intervals.icu). Copy to `.env` locally; set the same two in
# the Vercel project settings. Never expose these to the client — the sync runs
# only in `prebuild`, and the site fetches nothing at runtime.
#
# INTERVALS_ATHLETE_ID — your athlete id, e.g. i123456. It is in the URL when
#   you are logged in to intervals.icu.
# INTERVALS_API_KEY    — Settings → Developer → API key.
#
# Missing or invalid values are not fatal: the build falls back to the committed
# src/data/telemetry.json and logs a warning.
#
# After setting these locally, run the probe once to confirm the API field names
# match what the sync expects — it writes nothing:
#
#   INTERVALS_PROBE=1 node scripts/sync-intervals.mjs

INTERVALS_ATHLETE_ID=
INTERVALS_API_KEY=
